    {
      "kind": "section",
      "role": "contrast",
      "title": "Lexical s-verb or passive s-form",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "To decide what an s-form is doing, ask what the sentence means. A passive s-form is made from another verb and means that something is done to the subject. A lexical s-verb keeps its own dictionary meaning, such as opinion, well-being, existence, or a shared action."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "statement": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "If the sentence means someone or something is being used, done, sold, or called, treat the "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "s",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " as passive. If the verb means think, thrive, exist, meet each other, or see each other, treat it as a lexical s-verb."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Rommet brukes hver dag."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "The room is used every day."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Vi trives i rommet."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "We are happy and comfortable in the room."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "callout",
          "level": "warning",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "spans": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": "Do not remove the "
                },
                {
                  "kind": "foreign_term",
                  "value": "s",
                  "lang": "no"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": " from lexical s-verbs. "
                },
                {
                  "kind": "foreign_term",
                  "value": "Jeg syner filmen",
                  "lang": "no"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": " is not the natural way to say "
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": "I think the film"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": ". Use "
                },
                {
